  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wamunyu S.H.G Slaughter house</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Livestock - Meat Processing, Beneficiaries: 64 Smallholder Livestock Farmers, including 29 women. , The project funds will be used to hire office staff; train staff in good governance practices; purchase slaughter house equipment and train staff in financial management; develop policies for finances; human resources; and procurement; purchase office equipment; and provide cold room for the slaughter house and fence around the slaughter house.,</narrative>
  </description>
